  "story": {
    "day": 82,
    "title": "Kaya's School Fair Dreams",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya went to our school's first big sale.",
      "She found a man selling badminton club supplies.",
      "He had a thousand rulers under the table.",
      "Kaya wanted to get a white ruler and a stapler.",
      "\"Which subject is your best?\" he asked him.",
      "Kaya thought about Bali island in Indonesia.",
      "She dreamed of a white mountain and to bathe up high.",
      "Her second dream was to visit Paris and go there.",
      "She saw a hundred books about Spanish rice.",
      "One book had recipes from a Mexican chef whose age was seventeen.",
      "Maybe he was fifteen, sixteen, eighteen, or nineteen.",
      "Kaya wanted to touch his picture on the wall; he got zero points."
    ]
  }
